whats-next","title":"What's next"}],"full":"$undefined","children":[["$","$L18",null,{"children":"Runbooks"}],["$","$L19",null,{"children":"What to do when a Forge deployment is on fire: Redis failover, a worker OOM-killed, the disk full, and the queue backpressured. Each entry is a symptom, the signal that confirms it, the immediate action, and the change that stops it recurring."}],["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," you are on call and something is broken right now.\n",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," for each of the four incidents Forge\nactually produces, a confirming signal, a stop-the-bleeding action, and the\nconfiguration change that prevents a repeat. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," read once now, so you do\nnot read it for the first time at 03:00."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"data-prerequisites":true,"className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-5 py-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"my-0 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand","children":"Before you start"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground [&>p]:my-0","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"A deployment other people depend on."}]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["These are incident procedures. They deliberately do not explain how Forge\nworks (",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/explanations/architecture","children":"Architecture"}]," does that) and they do not\ntune anything. When you have stopped the bleeding and want to make the system\nfaster rather than merely alive, go to ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/operate/tuning","children":"Tuning"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["If you are not yet sure ",["$","em",null,{"children":"which"}]," incident you are having, start at\n",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/operate/troubleshooting","children":"Troubleshooting"}],", which indexes symptoms to causes.\nThis page assumes you already know."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-brand/40 bg-brand-soft/40 text-foreground","role":"note","children":["$L1c","$L1d"]}],"\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76","\n","$L77","\n","$L78","\n","$L79","\n","$L7a","\n","$L7b","\n","$L7c","\n","$L7d","\n","$L7e","\n","$L7f","\n","$L80","\n","$L81","\n","$L82","\n","$L83","\n","$L84","\n","$L85","\n","$L86","\n","$L87","\n","$L88"]}],"$L89"]}]
