1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"Two things to have open before you start"}],[["$","p",null,{"children":["The scheduler's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"INFO"}]," log. Most of Forge's diagnostic output is at\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"INFO"}],", and the shipped Compose example defaults to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"warn"}],". If you are at\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"warn"}]," you will see a hung system and nothing else. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"RUST_LOG=info"}]," is the first move in\nalmost every procedure below."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["A metrics pipeline. Several of these incidents are only visible as a rate\nchange. ",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/operate/observability","children":"Observability"}]," brings one up in about ten\nminutes; doing it during an incident is a bad trade, so do it beforehand."]}]]]}]
