42:["$","p",null,{"children":["The filesystem store keeps an executable-variant directory\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"{content_path}.exec"}],") alongside the content path, and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["that directory is\ninvisible to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"max_bytes"}]]}],". A variant is deleted when its primary entry is\nevicted, which bounds the total at roughly ",["$","code",null,{"children":"2 * max_bytes"}]," in the worst case\n(every blob also held as an executable). The variants are only ever created on\na worker, for executable inputs hardlinked out of its fast store, so this\napplies to worker fast tiers rather than to a CAS server's store."]}]
