46:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"temp_path"}]," must be on the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"same block device"}]," as ",["$","code",null,{"children":"content_path"}],". If it is\nnot, the atomic rename becomes a copy: slower, and it doubles peak space\nduring every write."]}]
47:["$","p",null,{"children":["Everything in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"temp_path"}]," is deleted at startup, and the content path is\nrescanned and re-accounted. A crash mid-write leaves a partial temp file that\nis reclaimed on the next boot, but only on the next boot. A process that\ncrashes repeatedly without a clean restart accumulates."]}]
