5a:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"ResourceExhausted"}]," is Forge's backpressure code. When a worker returns\nit for an action, two things happen: the action goes back to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Queued"}]," and\n(this is the important part) ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"its attempt counter is not incremented"}],". If\nthe worker still has other actions in flight it is also marked ",["$","code",null,{"children":"is_paused"}],",\nand that flag clears as soon as any of those actions completes."]}]
